      "lemma": "Outragedy of poetscalds",
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "text": "可听 outrage 与 tragedy 互撞，poet 与 scald 并置。译文兼留暴行与诗人；北欧诗人语源及自相残杀寓意待核。",
      "source_ids": [
        "joyce-fp"
